<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>方法论 on 梦开始的地方</title><link>https://git.yimeng.ch/categories/%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA/</link><description>Recent content in 方法论 on 梦开始的地方</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://git.yimeng.ch/categories/%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%AE%BA/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>从监控到理解：数据实验室的目标是什么</title><link>https://git.yimeng.ch/posts/from-monitoring-to-understanding/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://git.yimeng.ch/posts/from-monitoring-to-understanding/</guid><description>数据实验室的目标不是存数据，是理解家里发生了什么。单源数据的局限 vs 跨源数据的价值，数据挖掘 = 多源交叉验证。</description></item><item><title>数据驯化闭环：4C 框架实战</title><link>https://git.yimeng.ch/posts/data-taming-4c-framework/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://git.yimeng.ch/posts/data-taming-4c-framework/</guid><description>Catalog 编目、Calibrate 标定、Corroborate 印证、Guard 守护。数据可信度比数据量重要，不发明解释、不跨源推断、不用均值抹尖峰。</description></item><item><title>渐进式演进：不要大爆炸重构</title><link>https://git.yimeng.ch/posts/progressive-evolution/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://git.yimeng.ch/posts/progressive-evolution/</guid><description>一次性停掉所有旧服务上线新架构是危险的。正确做法：新链路先旁路运行，双写对账验证，逐个消费者迁移，观察期后再清理。</description></item></channel></rss>